## Overview
A minimalist, focused design system utilizing clean geometry, generous whitespace, and purposeful color contrast.

## Colors
- primary: #1D54D8 (Primary CTAs, Brand mark)
- background: #F8FAFC (Canvas background)
- surface: #FFFFFF (Card containers, Input fields)
- text: #475569 (Body typography, Neutral details)
- success: #10B981 (Positive status indicators)

## Typography
Clean neo-grotesque sans-serif typefaces (Inter) prioritizing high legibility across digital viewports.

## Layout
Structured modular grid with 24-32px padding on container elements and a clear single-column central focus.

## Elevation & Depth
Soft, diffuse ambient shadows to separate foreground surfaces from the canvas without harsh outlines.

## Shapes
Approachably rounded elements with 16px corner radii on cards and pill-shaped (full radius) interactive buttons.

## Components
- **Buttons**: Pill-shaped primary actions with high-contrast text.
- **Cards**: Soft-elevated white surfaces on light gray backgrounds.
- **Inputs**: Clean rounded fields with subtle borders.

## Do's and Don'ts
- **Do**: Maintain generous whitespace around central interactive elements.
- **Do**: Use high-contrast primary buttons for primary calls to action.
- **Don't**: Overcrowd interfaces with unnecessary border dividers.
- **Don't**: Use sharp 90-degree corners on primary interactive containers.
